13. DEVELOPER NOTES
This prompt provides comprehensive specifications for building a production-ready Chrome extension. The AI agent implementing this should have expertise in Chrome Extension development, React UI development, web scraping techniques, and modern JavaScript/TypeScript practices. All code should follow best practices for security, performance, and maintainability. The extension should be tested thoroughly across multiple job boards before release. Consider implementing telemetry (with user consent) to monitor extraction success rates and identify sites requiring additional extraction patterns.
Key success metrics for the completed extension include: extraction accuracy above 90% for core fields, support for at least 20 major job boards, UI response time under 100ms for typical interactions, and crash-free rate above 99.5%. Regular updates should address new job board patterns and anti-bot measures as they evolve.
